{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-97-1","title":"Psalms 97:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The majesty of God's kingdom. 7 The church rejoices at God's judgments upon idolaters. 10 An exhortation to godliness and gladness.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3000. B.C. 1004. Lord. 93:1; 96:10,11; 99:1; Ob 1:21; Mt 3:3; 6:10,13; Mr 11:10; Col 1:13 Re 11:17 the earth. 2:11; 98:4-6; Isa 49:13; Lu 2:10,11 let the multitude of isles. Heb. let the many, or greatisles. Ge 10:5; Isa 11:11; 24:14-16; 41:5; 42:4,10-12; 49:1; 51:5; 60:9 Isa 66:19; Zep 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-2","title":"Psalms 97:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Clouds. 18:11,12; 77:19; Ex 20:21; 24:16-18; De 4:11,12; 1Ki 8:10-12 Na 1:3; Ro 11:33 righteousness. 45:6,7; 89:14; 99:4; Ge 18:25; Heb 1:8,9 habitation. or, establishment. Pr 16:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-3","title":"Psalms 97:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>18:8; 21:8,9; 50:3; De 4:11,36; 5:4,23,24; 32:22; Da 7:10; Na 1:5,6 Hab 3:5; Mal 4:1; 2Th 1:8; Heb 12:29; 2Pe 3:10-12; Re 11:5; 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-4","title":"Psalms 97:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>His. 77:18; 144:5,6; Ex 19:16-18 the earth. 104:32; 114:7; Job 9:6; Jer 10:10; Mt 27:50,51; 28:2,3; Re 11:19 Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-5","title":"Psalms 97:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>hills. Jud 5:4,5; Isa 24:19,20; 64:1,2; Mic 1:3,4; Na 1:5; Hab 3:6 the Lord of. 47:2; 83:18; Isa 54:5; Mic 4:13; Zec 4:14; Mr 11:3; 1Co 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-6","title":"Psalms 97:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>The heavens. 19:1; 36:5,6; 50:6; 89:2,5; Isa 1:2; Re 19:2 all the. 67:4; 98:3; Nu 14:21; 2Sa 22:47; Isa 6:3; 45:6; 60:2,3; Hab 2:14 Mt 6:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-7","title":"Psalms 97:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Confounded. Ex 20:4; Le 26:1; De 5:8; 27:15; Isa 37:18,19; 41:29; 42:17; 44:9-11 Jer 10:14; Re 14:8-10 worship. Ex 25:20; 2Ch 3:13; Heb 1:6; 1Pe 1:12; Re 5:11-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-8","title":"Psalms 97:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Zion. 48:11; Isa 51:3; 52:7-10; 62:11; Zep 3:14-17; Zec 9:9; Mt 21:4-9 because. 52:6; 58:10; Re 18:20; 19:1-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-9","title":"Psalms 97:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>high. 83:18; Eph 1:21; Php 2:9-11 far. 95:3; 96:4; 115:3-8; 135:5; Ex 18:11; Jer 10:8,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-10","title":"Psalms 97:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ye that. 91:14; Ro 8:28; 1Co 8:3; Jas 1:12; 2:5; 1Pe 1:8; 1Jo 4:19; 5:2,3 hate. 34:14; 36:4; 37:27; 101:3; 119:104,163; Pr 3:7; 8:13; Am 5:15 Ro 7:15,24; 12:9 preserveth. 31:23; 37:28,39,40; 145:20; Pr 2:8; Isa 45:17; Joh 20:28-30 Ro 8:28-30; 1Pe 1:5 delivereth. 125:3; Jer 15:21; Da 3:28; 6:22,27; 2Th 2:8-12; 3:2; 1Jo 5:18 Re 13:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-11","title":"Psalms 97:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Light. 18:28; 112:4; Es 8:16; Job 22:28; Pr 4:18; Isa 60:1,2; 62:1; Mic 7:9 Joh 12:46; Re 21:23; 22:5 sown. 126:5,6; Ga 6:8; Jas 5:7-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-97-12","title":"Psalms 97:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":97,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":97,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Rejoice. 32:11; 33:1; Hab 3:17,18; Zep 3:14-17; Php 4:4 give thanks. 30:4; 60:6; Hab 1:12,13; Heb 12:10 at the remembrance. or, to the memorial.</p>"}]}